cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "AI search citations dataset"
abstract: >-
  Monthly open dataset of the websites that ChatGPT, Google AI Overviews,
  Google AI Mode, Gemini, Microsoft Copilot and Claude list as sources when
  buyers ask about AI search, generative engine optimization (GEO) and AI
  visibility. Release 2026.10 covers 138 answers (23 prompts on 6 engines)
  collected from the United States on 2026-10-14.
authors:
  - name: "Cited (cited.io)"
    website: "https://cited.io"
version: "2026.10"
date-released: "2026-10-15"
license: CC-BY-4.0
url: "https://github.com/Cited-io/ai-search-citations-dataset"
keywords:
  - ai search
  - generative engine optimization
  - answer engine optimization
  - ai visibility
  - citations
  - chatgpt
  - google ai overviews
  - gemini
  - copilot
  - claude
